      en: ["Officially opened by King Mswati III in 1998.", "Consists of 16 authentic huts built without using any nails.", "The central component is the kraal for cattle in the middle of the village.", "Sibhaca dances are performed twice daily by a dance troupe.", "Houses exhibitions on traditional craftsmanship and medicine.", "The adjacent Mantenga Waterfall has a drop of approximately 95 meters."],
      es: ["Inaugurado en 1990.", "40 empleados.", "20.000 visitantes al año.", "Chozas en colmena: 15.", "Danzas diarias: 2 presentaciones.", "Precio de entrada: 100 SZL."],
