      en: ["The region is primarily irrigated by the Great Usutu River.", "Ubombo Sugar operates one of the country's largest sugar mills here.", "The sugar cane harvest takes place annually between April and November.", "Big Bend is located about 100 meters above sea level, providing an ideal climate.", "Sugar accounts for over 50% of Eswatini's total agricultural exports.", "The mill also produces electricity from biomass (bagasse) for the local grid."],
