      en: ["The operation was established in 1949 as Ubombo Ranches.", "It is situated near the town of Big Bend in the Eswatini Lowveld.", "The company is part of the Illovo Sugar Africa group.", "Water for irrigation is drawn extensively from the Great Usutu River.", "The sugar mill co-generates electricity using bagasse as a renewable fuel.", "Ubombo Sugar provides essential social services, including a hospital and housing."],
